        "spans_beyond_this_verse": true,
        "translator": "K. M. K. Murthy / Desiraju Hanumanta Rao",
        "text": "They never speak untruthful words in anger or in greed or for monetary reasons either. There is nothing unknown to them, even a little, in their own country or in the others either, or about everything that is happening or has happened, or that is going to happen, for they know them through agents. [1-7-8b, 9]"
      }
